notes.content:
Hello there! For the last month I had actively fixing bugs. Also, I added some cool new features in the latest 1.4 update!

So what’s new?


 Fixed a crash that some players experienced in the second half of the demo;
 A brand new Tarot Card (available after completing the demo for the first time);
 Some minor changes to the combat system that I believe will improve the overall experience;
 Now you can choose "Streamer Mode" from the main menu that will hide your personal information (sometimes the game can show your Windows username);
 For the new players: now the tutorial is much more difficult to miss! ;)


Have fun!
